%% Diagram 5 - Assessment sequence (create to decision)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor BU as Business user
  actor AN as FCRM analyst
  actor MG as Manager
  actor CM as Committee
  participant FE as React SPA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant JOB as Job runner
  participant LG as LangGraph
  participant LLM as OpenRouter
  participant DB as Neon Postgres

  BU->>FE: Fill intake, Submit
  FE->>API: POST /api/assessments
  API->>DB: insert assessment, transition CREATED, audit
  API-->>FE: 201 AssessmentResponse
  AN->>FE: Confirm profile
  FE->>API: POST /intelligence/confirm
  AN->>FE: Run risk identification
  FE->>API: POST /analyze-async
  API->>DB: insert processing_job + analysis_run QUEUED
  API-->>FE: 202 job id
  API->>JOB: enqueue
  JOB->>LG: invoke(run_id)
  LG->>DB: load context, attested reference data
  LG->>LLM: masked prompt v2.0.0, pinned model
  LLM-->>LG: JSON factors, no scores
  LG->>LG: verify_evidence, tag, score_provisional
  LG->>DB: supersede factors, calc, finish run, transition to RISK_IDENTIFICATION
  loop every 1-2 s until finished
    FE->>API: GET /processing-jobs/{id}
    API-->>FE: progress, stage_key
  end
  AN->>FE: Rate each factor L x I
  FE->>API: PATCH /risk-factors/{fid}/rating
  API->>DB: factor version, inherent calc version, audit before/after
  AN->>FE: Map and assess controls, freeze residual, accept draft
  BU->>FE: Submit to manager
  FE->>API: POST /submit-to-manager
  MG->>FE: Approve
  FE->>API: POST /manager-decision
  API->>DB: gates checked, transition READY_FOR_COMMITTEE
  CM->>FE: Vote, then decide
  FE->>API: POST /committee-votes, POST /committee-decision
  API->>DB: transition APPROVED, conditions, action items, decision_record + checksum
  API-->>FE: 200 decision recorded
